				},
				{
					"id": 4670307,
					"content": "The taste is... hard to describe. A borderline pass!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4670308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lynn"
				},
				{
					"id": 4670308,
					"content": "#What? {NICKNAME} can do better. That doesn't count!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4670309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 4670309,
					"content": "You have great potential. All you need is more practice.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4670310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lynn"
				},
				{
					"id": 4670310,
					"content": "Oh. I've got some raw ingredients in my bag. Have them in return for this meal.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4670311
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lynn"
				},
				{
					"id": 4670311,
					"content": "Can we really have them? Won't you run out of ingredients?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4670312
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 4670312,
					"content": "That's okay. You should be able to find lots of ingredients when <color=#00E1FFFF>exploring the wilderness</color>. Don't forget to look carefully.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4670313
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lynn"
				},
				{
					"id": 4670313,
					"content": "There's also a restaurant in Mondstadt known as <color=#00E1FFFF>Good Hunter</color> that sells food and ingredients. Go have a look when you've got the time.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4670314
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lynn"
				},
				{
					"id": 4670314,
					"content": "Okay, thank you for the info. *gasp* Hey! Leave some Chicken-Mushroom Skewers for Paimon!",
